{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03243","headline":"至端州驿见杜五审言沈三佺期阎五朝隐王二无竞题壁慨然成咏 · 宋之问","name":"至端州驿见杜五审言沈三佺期阎五朝隐王二无竞题壁慨然成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐臣北地承严谴，谓到南中每相见。\n岂意南中岐路多，千山万水分乡县。\n云摇雨散各翻飞，海阔天长音信稀。\n处处山川同瘴疠，自怜能得几人归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}